Package: zeromesh
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZeroMesh Maintainers <maintainers@zeromesh.net>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libprotobuf32t64 | libprotobuf-dev, libgrpc++1.51t64 | libgrpc++-dev, libsodium23 | libsodium-dev, libssl3 | libssl-dev, bubblewrap, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-protobuf, python3-grpcio
Description: Zero-setup peer-to-peer compute and storage mesh daemon and CLI
 ZeroMesh pools idle Linux machines on a LAN into a single, low-latency compute
 mesh. It features content-addressable caching, mTLS authentication, sandbox
 execution, and a pluggable architecture.
 .
 Firewall ports:
  - 8981/tcp: NodeApi mutual TLS remote execution
  - 8988/udp: Multicast team discovery
